### Health check (publiczny)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/slots/health

### Rejestracja admina (w user-service!)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@medical.com",
  "password": "admin123",
  "firstName": "Admin",
  "lastName": "System",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### Logowanie admina (skopiuj token stąd!)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@medical.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Dodaj lekarza (wymaga tokenu ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/doctors
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "firstName": "Anna",
  "lastName": "Nowak",
  "specialization": "Kardiologia",
  "roomNumber": "101",
  "phoneNumber": "123456789"
}

### Lista lekarzy
GET http://localhost:8082/api/doctors
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Dodaj slot
POST http://localhost:8082/api/slots
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "doctorId": 1,
  "startTime": "2026-04-01T10:00:00"
}

### Lista dostępnych slotów
GET http://localhost:8082/api/slots/available
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}